<title>ESTONIA: KAUBAMAJA SHARE CAPITAL RISE REGISTERED.</title>
<headline>KAUBAMAJA SHARE CAPITAL RISE REGISTERED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Kaubamaja has increased its share capital to 67.82 million kroons as of June 30, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>From July 3 all trade in the department store's shares will be under the same name, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Under bourse regulations, shares issued as part of a share capital increase must be traded seperately until the increase is registered in the companies register.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
